            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'd like to create a plugin for this, with something like the following behavior:\n\n\n_When the user presses `[\"x]<something>`, the contents of register `x` are split by newline and distributed across the cursors, in order (either by their position in the buffer or by the order in which they were added)._\n\nBut implementing this with the current API would be too hacky and not very robust.",
